{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1104348-time-of-judgement-ascension","id":1104348,"title":"Time of Judgement : Ascension","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-16T10:08:42-07:00","id":1104348,"title":"Time of Judgement : Ascension","content":"Hi everyone ! It's been time and I was busy with many things but I'm back !<br /> <br /> I'm currently reading the Time of Judgement book for Mage and I'm passionate about the first scenario which is about the conclusion of the metaplot. Do you have suggestions for side-readings ? I was maybe thinking about some Tradition Books (Hermes, Cult of Ecstasy, Euthanatos, Ahl-i-Batin) and the Horizon Book and the Long Road. I think I will also read the Ascension War trilogy. The objective is to offer a final story arc to a two years campaign.<br /> <br /> My campaign had originally small tides to the official metaplot, but my Mages growing powerful, I more and more added backgroud lore to the story. Has someone already played that scenario and what do you think or advice about it ?<br /> <br /> Thank you very much !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8572-nicotheduck","name":"NicoTheDuck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-16T17:14:46-07:00","id":1104547,"title":"","content":"If you liked that world end, and want to have Traditionalists, you may like:<br /> <br /> The book of the Rogue Council, that figures prominently in that end, I think it's also where the Psychopomps appear for the first time. This is the most related book I can think.<br /> <br /> The Guide to the Traditions for data on the Traditions, and it has some fluf implying that the slaughtering of the Janissary was part of a conspiracy.<br /> <br /> Maybe something of Cruzade, for the Ksirafai the previous incarnation of the Cult of Ixion<br /> <br /> Also Infinite Tapestry for data on the Umbra, Shard Realms, it also has some stuff about Annakim and Psychopomps, but is nothing that isn't better explained in Ascencion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-20T04:24:52-07:00","id":1105646,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much. I'll look into that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8572-nicotheduck","name":"NicoTheDuck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}